# The simulator's own launchd jobs that make a new device's first boot hold the runner's load at 500 to 900 for about
# 15 min (gatefold#198): lock-screen posters, Spotlight and search, photo and media analysis, widgets, Siri, Home,
# maps, weather and trial downloads. boot-sim.sh and ci-simulator.py's erase disable and remove them once the device has
# booted (gatefold#209: XCUITest timed out launching the app inside that load). Gatefold uses none of them; never list
# a job XCUITest needs (accessibility, testmanagerd, runningboardd, SpringBoard).
# Probe 42965000531: with these gone, load under 25 about 4 min after the boot and a Settings launch 0.5 to 2.5 s;
# without, about 18 min and launches of 351 s, 79 s, 25 s.
com.apple.PosterBoard
com.apple.contacts.postersyncd
com.apple.Spotlight
com.apple.searchd
com.apple.corespotlightservice
com.apple.hybridsearchd
com.apple.spotlightknowledged
com.apple.spotlightknowledged.updater
com.apple.knowledgeconstructiond
com.apple.suggestd
com.apple.photoanalysisd
com.apple.mediaanalysisd
com.apple.mediaanalysisd.service
com.apple.assetsd
com.apple.assetsd.nebulad
com.apple.cloudphotod
com.apple.managedassetsd
com.apple.chronod
com.apple.siriactionsd
com.apple.siriknowledged
